{"name":"Breakwater","hex":"#d1dee4","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Breakwater","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A suburb of Geelong, Victoria, Australia"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Breakwater"}],"entries":[{"title":"Breakwater (structure)","blocks":[{"text":"A breakwater is a permanent structure constructed at a coastal area to protect against tides, currents, waves, and storm surges. Breakwaters have been built since antiquity to protect anchorages, helping isolate vessels from marine hazards such as wind-driven waves. A breakwater, also known in some contexts as a jetty or a mole, may be connected to land or freestanding, and may contain a walkway or road for vehicle access."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Breakwater_break1_new%28USGS%29.jpg/330px-Breakwater_break1_new%28USGS%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakwater_(structure)"},{"title":"Breakwater, Victoria","blocks":[{"text":"Breakwater is a residential and industrial suburb of Geelong, Victoria, Australia, located on the Barwon River, 4 km south-south-east of the Geelong central business district. At the 2016 census Breakwater had a population of 1,014. Breakwater is home to the Geelong Racing Club, Geelong Racecourse and the Geelong Showgrounds."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Breakwater-bridge-geelong.jpg/330px-Breakwater-bridge-geelong.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakwater%2C_Victoria"},{"title":"Breakwater (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Breakwater is an American funk band from Philadelphia. The band released two albums: Breakwater in 1978, and Splashdown in 1980. The latter features the song \"Release the Beast\", which was sampled on \"Robot Rock\" by the electronic duo Daft Punk."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakwater_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg/500px-V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg/1280px-V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg/500px-V%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Breakwater under construction in Ystad, Sweden (2019)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AV%C3%A5gbrytare_-_Ystad-2019.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg/500px-Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg/1280px-Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg/500px-Breakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A breakwater in Haukilahti, Espoo, Finland","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABreakwater_in_Haukilahti.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Quebra_Mar_by_Diego_Baravelli.jpg/500px-Quebra_Mar_by_Diego_Baravelli.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Quebra_Mar_by_Diego_Baravelli.jpg/1280px-Quebra_Mar_by_Diego_Baravelli.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/